# Gemfile.lock is tracked on purpose: without it on the default branch
# Dependabot cannot see which gem versions are actually in use, so its
# alerts never close and it never opens a fix PR. GitHub Pages ignores
# this file (it builds with its own bundle), so tracking it is free.
# # End of https://www.toptal.com/developers/gitignore/api/jekyll

